   "title": "Flowers that feel just picked",
   "front_page": true,
   "featured_media": "hero",
   "excerpt": "Seasonal bouquets, wedding flowers and weekly subscriptions from our little studio, arranged by hand every morning.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center eyebrow\">The bouquet catalogue</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Made this morning, <em>delivered today</em></h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"bouquet-grid\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide bouquet-grid\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"bouquet\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group bouquet\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:bouquet-blush}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:bouquet-blush}}\" alt=\"Blush bouquet\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:bouquet-blush}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Blush</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Garden roses, sweet peas and spray roses in soft pinks.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"price\"} --><p class=\"price\">&euro;48</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Order</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"bouquet\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group bouquet\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:bouquet-meadow}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:bouquet-meadow}}\" alt=\"Meadow bouquet\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:bouquet-meadow}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Meadow</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A loose, wild mix of whatever the fields are offering.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"price\"} --><p class=\"price\">&euro;42</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Order</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"bouquet\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group bouquet\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:bouquet-autumn}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:bouquet-autumn}}\" alt=\"Harvest bouquet\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:bouquet-autumn}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Harvest</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dahlias, rust chrysanthemums and grasses.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"price\"} --><p class=\"price\">&euro;52</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Order</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:bouquets}}\">See every bouquet</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"band-moss\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull band-moss\"><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"split-band\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns split-band\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:wedding}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:wedding}}\" alt=\"A wedding arch of meadow flowers\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:wedding}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"eyebrow\">Weddings &amp; events</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Flowers for your <em>big day</em></h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>From a single bouquet to an orchard full of blooms, we design wedding and event flowers that feel personal, seasonal and alive.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:weddings-events}}\">Plan your flowers</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center eyebrow\">From the journal</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Care guides &amp; <em>seasonal notes</em></h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"journal-strip\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide journal-strip\"><!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":3,\"displayPostDate\":true,\"displayPostContent\":true,\"excerptLength\":18,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"columns\":3} /--></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"band-blush\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull band-blush\"><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"testimonials\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns testimonials\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The most beautiful flowers I have ever received. They lasted nearly two weeks.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Hanne, a regular</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>They understood exactly what we wanted for the wedding, even before we did.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Theo &amp; Mai</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>My Friday flower subscription is the best thing I do for myself.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Ruth</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
